            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The error indicates that there are no tags generated for 'mini.nvim'. [This line](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/ddb70da6ec6aa896cfde87350d1e8dffb57ddef0/scripts/init-deps-example.lua#L8) is responsible for generating tags and should have done it on the first install.\r\n\r\nYou can manually execute `:helptags ALL` now and `:h MiniPick` should work.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The error indicates that there are no tags generated for 'mini.nvim'. <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/ddb70da6ec6aa896cfde87350d1e8dffb57ddef0/scripts/init-deps-example.lua#L8\">This line</a> is responsible for generating tags and should have done it on the first install.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can manually execute <code class=\"notranslate\">:helptags ALL</code> now and <code class=\"notranslate\">:h MiniPick</code> should work.</p>",
            "bodyText": "The error indicates that there are no tags generated for 'mini.nvim'. This line is responsible for generating tags and should have done it on the first install.\nYou can manually execute :helptags ALL now and :h MiniPick should work.",
